"schema":"harvard-drs-431236545-transcription/1","units":[{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u001","layer":"paratext","order":1,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"paratext","text":"廣孝歸宗論","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u002","layer":"body","order":2,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"人皆知孝以事親。此固第一要事。孔子曰、孝德之本也。誠哉是","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["固"],"length":1,"offset":9,"reason":"字形近「固」，內部筆畫有淡斑，不夠清晰"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u003","layer":"body","order":3,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"言。蓋爲孝子、則必知忠以事君敬以事上。故達則爲賢臣。隱則","uncertainties":[{"candidates":[],"length":1,"offset":17,"reason":"「君」字之後可能有圈點，墨色淡，未能確定，暫不加"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u004","layer":"body","order":4,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"爲良民。而誠以事上帝更爲第一要事。人能虔事上帝必知孝","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u005","layer":"body","order":5,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"以事親。忠以事君。敬以事上。故能事上帝。而孝子、賢臣、良民盡","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u006","layer":"body","order":6,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"在其內。蓋此皆天性。能事上帝必能盡天性也。父母之恩。不忍","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u007","layer":"body","order":7,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"不報。而上帝之恩更萬倍於父母。何則、上帝既造我。又以仁慈","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u008","layer":"body","order":8,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"畀我親令愛我。以公明付我君令護我。又生米肉諸物。以飽我。","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u009","layer":"body","order":9,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"生裘棉諸物。以暖我。又生牛馬諸畜。以代我勞。生猪羊諸畜、以","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u010","layer":"body","order":10,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"悅我口。世間一切猛獸、珍禽、昆蟲皆許我統理之。或馴擾畜養。","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["口"],"length":1,"offset":2,"reason":"字形小，筆畫淡，判為「口」"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u011","layer":"body","order":11,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"或寢皮食肉。惟意所欲。無能抗者。又與我靈慧能探索天地間","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u012","layer":"body","order":12,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"一切妙理。以悅我神心。上帝之恩。眞天高地厚。不能比。擢髮不","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u013","layer":"body","order":13,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"能數矣。而不竭誠事之。以圖報萬一。我心忍乎。亂臣、逆子、凶僕","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["以"],"length":1,"offset":11,"reason":"折痕和斑點遮住部分筆畫"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u014","layer":"body","order":14,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"爲世大惡。罪不容誅。而湏背上帝之恩。其罪深於亂臣、逆子、惡","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["湏","竟"],"length":1,"offset":11,"reason":"在白色破洞和貼補紙帶邊緣，筆畫殘缺，字形近「湏」"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u015","layer":"body","order":15,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"僕、億萬倍乎。君或暴虐。士或昏亂。臣僕背之。猶可推諉。而上帝","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["士","主"],"length":1,"offset":12,"reason":"在橙色斑和破洞旁，上部筆畫不清，可見字形近「士」"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u016","layer":"body","order":16,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"極睿智大仁慈。至公明。不知敬事者。罪無可解也。亂臣逆子。君","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["慈"],"length":1,"offset":5,"reason":"藍黑色墨漬蓋住大半筆畫"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u017","layer":"body","order":17,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"父必棄絶之誅僇之。不事上帝。甚於亂臣。上帝有不棄絶之誅","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u018","layer":"body","order":18,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"僇之乎。故不事上帝。乃蹈至危機。入大險地。一旦禍臨。無可逭","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["蹈至危"],"length":3,"offset":11,"reason":"橫向貼補紙帶覆蓋，筆畫透過補紙才看得見"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u019","layer":"body","order":19,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"囘也。國無刑典。則惡人肆。而善人懼。故雖仁慈之主。不能廢刑。","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u020","layer":"body","order":20,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"上帝亦若是矣。故背之者。罰無赦。然而上帝不顯僇人於生前。","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["者"],"length":1,"offset":10,"reason":"墨漬和貼補紙帶遮住部分筆畫"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u021","layer":"body","order":21,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"恒含忍之。而望其一旦悔改也。至死不變。則罪無可逭。故身後","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["悔改"],"length":2,"offset":10,"reason":"橫向貼補紙帶覆蓋，字跡模糊"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u022","layer":"body","order":22,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"之罰。無能倖免也。人俱言上帝至尊至大。惟君上方可拜。我小","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u023","layer":"body","order":23,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"民何敢拜之。故當拜佛與神。以求赦罪。此大謬。上帝乃人之根","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u024","layer":"body","order":24,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"本。拜上帝乃人之分內事。正惟其至尊大。故愈當竭誠事之耳。","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["分"],"length":1,"offset":8,"reason":"字形與通行寫法略異，判為「分」"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u025","layer":"body","order":25,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"若事神佛。譬如背父母。而事路人。而欲求其顧復我。有是理乎。","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["母"],"length":1,"offset":9,"reason":"左側框外有藍黑色墨漬，加上貼補紙帶，邊緣筆畫受影響"}]}]}
